  "description": {
    "text": "The 2004 Stadium Challenges were held in Switzerland and Germany in May and June 2004 and in the United States in July, at Arlington, Texas, on 10 July and at Rockville, Maryland, and Berkeley, California, on 17 July. Every registered player got Mitsuhiro Arita's Metang with the Stadium Challenge logo, and the top sixteen of each age group at the US events won prizes, the winners an invitation to the World Championships. One Gym Challenge in May 2004 was sent these Metang by mistake.",
